# Seat 0 closes 1m, 9m and 1p, then feeds seat 1 the fourth 9p.
# Seat 1 discards its replacement 5z. Seat 2 submits pon and nobody rons.
# Tenhou reveals 7z before the discard. Mahjong Soul's default waits for the
# ron window to pass; the proposed order still places 7z before suukaikan.
# The abort overrides the pon, moves zero points or sticks and repeats East 1
# with honba increasing from 0 to 1.

[meta]
name: suukaikan_open_kan_owed_dora
title: Fourth open kan reveals owed dora at the discard before the four-kan abort
rules: both
source: rules.md §1 kan_dora_daiminkan_timing, §4.22, engine.md §4.2
unverified: rules.md §5 item 4 (Mahjong Soul owed dora on a four-kan abort)

